  "name": "Conjure Constructs",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Conjure the intangible spirits within 60 ft (they last while you concentrate, up to 10 minutes). When you cast the spell, and as a Magic action later, pick a creature within 5 ft of the spirits and use <strong>Clockwork Force</strong> (DEX save, 3d6 Force, half on a success) or <strong>Orderly Ward</strong> (Temporary Hit Points equal to 1d6 + your spellcasting modifier). Both grow by 1d6 per slot level above 3. When you move, you can also move the spirits up to 30 ft.</p>",
